{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01M6ZuUZ8CuyFQf9SDr9yAdc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan, assuming the \"best\" tier outcome. I need to provide specific metric predictions with rationales for why those results would occur under the best-case scenario.\n\nLet me identify all planned experiments:\n\n1. exp-ctrl-contam-pilot (planned) - P0-CRITICAL\n2. exp-ctrl-contam (planned) - P0\n3. exp-leaderboard-audit (planned) - P1\n4. exp-4pl-ablation (planned) - P2\n\n\n5. exp-baseline-comparison (planned) - P0-end\n6. exp-multiscale-lzm (planned) - P2\n7. exp-post-rl (planned) - P2\n8. exp-extra-benchmarks (planned) - P2\n9. exp-domain-analysis (planned) - P2\n\nNow I'm working through the best-tier metric thresholds to establish what constitutes top-tier performance across these experiments, then I'll generate specific predictions for each one based on those benchmarks.\n\nThe key performance indicators I'm tracking include effect sizes on MMLU, detection accuracy across contamination levels, coverage of leaderboard models, and signal retention after reinforcement learning. The narrative here is that the original framing holds up strongly—we can detect 15% contamination with high confidence, scale the analysis to thousands of models, and maintain meaningful signal even after RL fine-tuning.\n\nNow I'm diving into the first experiment to establish baseline predictions.\n\nFor the controlled contamination pilot, I'm testing Qwen3.5-9B across three contamination levels on MMLU alone. At 15% contamination, the effect size is substantial—Cohen's d around 2.0—which should create a detectable shift in the loss landscape metric. The clean model should show extreme misfit patterns, while the contaminated version shifts further into aberrance as the SFT learns from those ~2100 contaminated items.\n\nThe larger controlled contamination experiment scales this across four models, six contamination levels, and three benchmarks. I'm aiming for at least 80% detection rate across model-benchmark pairs, with AUROC between 0.90 and 0.98 at the 15% level on MMLU. Now I'm examining how detection generalizes across different benchmarks.\n\nFor the leaderboard audit, I'm scanning 13K+ models to find systematic patterns and flag a meaningful subset with clustering. The 4PL ablation compares the four-parameter logistic model against the three-parameter version to see if the extra flexibility meaningfully improves detection. Against competing methods like ConStat and Min-K%++, I expect IRT-FIT to be slightly worse but still competitive, with AUROC gaps in the -0.10 to -0.02 range. I'm also testing a cross-benchmark aggregated statistic and checking how much signal persists after post-RL training—aiming for 40-80% retention. Finally, I'm extending to BBH and MATH to round out the benchmark coverage.\n\nNow I'm diving into domain-level analysis on MMLU to uncover contamination patterns that vary across different subject areas.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14775,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14775},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b274d9b3-3643-46ca-a844-af844970b704","uuid":"b04f0ec7-1beb-4b89-babd-6fa1535b2dc6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01M6ZuUZ8CuyFQf9SDr9yAdc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Headline: \"Using only binary responses, IRT-FIT detects 15% SFT\n  contamination on MMLU with AUROC 0.94; a 13K-model leaderboard audit reveals systematic\n  contamination patterns in 8.3% of submissions.\" 三条 Claims 以强形式陈述。Claim 1 由控制实验\n  验证——Δlz* Cohen's d=2.1 在 MMLU 15% 污染，well-calibrated null 上统计显著，universal model\n  misfit 不妨碍 within-model detection。Claim 2 的 power function + dual-regime 由理论推导、\n  扩展模拟和控制实验三重支撑，BBH/MATH 填补 1K-10K gap。Claim 3 的 leaderboard audit 分析 11K+ 模型，\n  发现 time-correlated contamination waves 和 model-family clustering，从 exploratory 升级为\n  validated large-scale application。Post-RL 信号保留 62% 成为额外亮点，直接回应 Wang et al. (2025)。\n  Baseline 对比显示 IRT-FIT AUROC 仅低于 Min-K%++ 5pp，但在 minimal-information 条件下实现，\n  cost-benefit 极优。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B × 3 levels (0%/15%/50%) × MMLU only。QLoRA SFT 注入指定比例 MMLU items，\n      评估全 14K items 的 binary responses，计算 lz* 并与 clean baseline 对比 Δlz*。\n      Go/no-go gate for 整个控制实验线。\n    expected_results:\n      clean_lz_star_mean: -18.5\n      clean_lz_star_std: 2.3\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_mean: -23.1\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_std: 2.8\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_mean: -31.6\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_std: 3.1\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_mean: -4.6\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_cohen_d: 1.8\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_mean: -13.1\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_cohen_d: 4.7\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_p_value: \"<1e-4\"\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_p_value: \"<1e-8\"\n      accuracy_gain_15pct: 0.04\n      accuracy_gain_50pct: 0.12\n      n_runs_per_level: 3\n      go_nogo: \"GO\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Clean Qwen3.5-9B 在 MMLU 上已有极端负 lz*（universal misfit），约 -18 到 -19。\n      15% SFT 污染注入 ~2100 items 的 correct answers，这些 items 中包含大量 high-difficulty\n      items（θ_item > θ_model），模型原本会答错但 SFT 后答对。这种 \"答对不该答对的难题\" 模式\n      正是 lz* 设计要捕捉的 aberrance——在 IRT 框架下等价于考生有 preknowledge。由于 MMLU 有\n      14K items，~2100 contaminated items 产生的 aberrant signal 在 lz* 的 sum-of-residuals\n      结构中累积为显著负向偏移。Cohen's d=1.8 处于 best 档 [1.5, 3.0] 范围内，因为：\n      (a) MMLU n_items=14K 使 lz* 方差较小（Var(lz*)∝1/n），放大标准化效应量；\n      (b) SFT 在 QLoRA 下产生 localized parameter changes，contaminated items 的 accuracy\n      接近 1.0 而 non-contaminated items 变化微小，产生清晰的 aberrant pattern；\n      (c) 3 runs 的 seed 变异主要来自 SFT 随机性，不足以淹没 signal。\n      50% 污染效应更强（d=4.7）因为 ~7000 contaminated items 占半数以上，aberrance 信号\n      接近 saturation。Accuracy gain 较温和（+4pp at 15%）因为 SFT 主要影响 contaminated items\n      中原本答错的子集（~40-60% of contaminated items），而非全部。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pilot Δlz* Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Level\", \"lz*_mean\", \"lz*_std\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p (paired t)\", \"Acc\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0% (clean)\", \"-18.5\", \"2.3\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"0.63\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"-23.1\", \"2.8\", \"-4.6\", \"1.8\", \"<1e-4\", \"0.67\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"-31.6\", \"3.1\", \"-13.1\", \"4.7\", \"<1e-8\", \"0.75\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Pilot lz* distribution (3 seeds × 3 levels). Violin plot 显示 clean→15%→50% 的 lz* 下移趋势，with individual run points overlaid.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pilot 确认 go/no-go: Δlz* 在 15% 已统计显著，Cohen's d=1.8 表明 effect size large。\n      关键观察：(1) clean baseline 的 lz* 已极端（-18.5），confirm universal misfit；\n      (2) 但 within-model Δlz* 仍可分离，因为 contamination 产生的 aberrance 叠加在 misfit 之上；\n      (3) accuracy gain 温和说明 lz* 捕捉的是 pattern anomaly 而非 performance boost。\n      这为 full exp-ctrl-contam 提供强 go signal。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      4 模型 (Qwen3.5-9B, Gemma-4-31B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) ×\n      6 levels (0%/5%/10%/15%/25%/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU, GSM8K, HellaSwag)。\n      QLoRA SFT 注入，每 setting 3 seeds。建立 ground-truth contamination→Δlz* 映射。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU results (n=14042)\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_5pct: 0.9\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_10pct: 1.4\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 2.1\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct: 3.8\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct: 5.2\n      mmlu_auroc_5pct: 0.78\n      mmlu_auroc_10pct: 0.87\n      mmlu_auroc_15pct: 0.94\n      mmlu_auroc_25pct: 0.99\n      mmlu_auroc_50pct: 1.0\n      # HellaSwag results (n=10042)\n      hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 1.6\n      hellaswag_auroc_15pct: 0.90\n      hellaswag_auroc_50pct: 0.99\n      # GSM8K results (n=1319)\n      gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 0.8\n      gsm8k_auroc_15pct: 0.72\n      gsm8k_auroc_50pct: 0.93\n      # Cross-model consistency\n      cross_model_detectable_frac_mmlu_15pct: 1.0\n      cross_model_detectable_frac_hellaswag_15pct: 0.75\n      cross_model_detectable_frac_gsm8k_15pct: 0.50\n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_15pct: 0.83\n      overall_detectable_frac_all_cells: 0.85\n      min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct: 10\n      min_detectable_contam_hellaswag_pct: 15\n      min_detectable_contam_gsm8k_pct: 25\n      n_total_cells: 72\n      n_detectable_cells_15pct: 10/12\n    result_rationale: >\n      MMLU 结果最强，因 n_items=14042 是三个 benchmark 中最大的。根据 exp-power-theory 的\n      sqrt(n) 关系，lz* 的 discrimination power ∝ sqrt(n_items)：MMLU(14K) > HellaSwag(10K)\n      > GSM8K(1.3K)。在 best 档下：\n      \n      (1) MMLU 15% AUROC=0.94：4 模型全部可检测（4/4），因为 14K items 下即使最弱模型\n      (Mistral-7B) 的 Δlz* 也足够显著。Cohen's d=2.1 处于 best 档 [1.5,3.0] 中部，反映\n      SFT contamination 的 localized effect——contaminated items 上 accuracy 跳升但\n      non-contaminated items 基本不变，IRT residuals 在 contaminated subset 上系统偏离。\n      5% contamination 在 MMLU 上已可部分检测（AUROC=0.78），因为 ~700 items 的信号在\n      14K-item 的 lz* 中仍可累积。min_detectable 约 10%（AUROC>0.80 门槛）。\n      \n      (2) HellaSwag 15% AUROC=0.90：n=10K 提供足够 power 但低于 MMLU。3/4 模型可检测，\n      Gemma-4-31B 可能因较高 baseline ability (θ接近 ceiling) 导致 contamination 的\n      marginal effect 较小。HellaSwag 的 completion-style format 使 SFT 记忆效果\n      slightly less localized than MMLU MCQ。\n      \n      (3) GSM8K 15% AUROC=0.72：n=1319 严重限制 power。根据 exp-power-theory 的\n      min_items_15pct_80power=7958，GSM8K 远低于此阈值。仅 2/4 模型在 15% 可检测。\n      但 50% 时 AUROC 升至 0.93，因为 ~660 contaminated items 的信号终于足够强。\n      \n      (4) 跨模型一致性 0.83（10/12 cells at 15%）满足 best 档 [0.8, 1.0]：MMLU 全部\n      通过，HellaSwag 3/4，GSM8K 对 best 档贡献 1/4（仅最大模型 Gemma 可检测）。\n      一致性好的根本原因是 SFT contamination 产生的 aberrant pattern 与模型架构无关——\n      它本质上是 \"在特定 items 上 accuracy 跳升\" 的 universal signature。\n      \n      (5) 模型间 Cohen's d 变异适中（CV~20%）：Qwen 和 Llama 效应最强（较低 baseline\n      ability，contamination marginal gain 大），Gemma 最弱（高 baseline，部分\n      contaminated items 本就能答对）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC by Model × Benchmark × Level\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Benchmark\", \"5%\", \"10%\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"MMLU\", \"0.81\", \"0.90\", \"0.96\", \"0.99\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"MMLU\", \"0.74\", \"0.84\", \"0.91\", \"0.98\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"MMLU\", \"0.80\", \"0.89\", \"0.95\", \"0.99\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B\", \"MMLU\", \"0.76\", \"0.86\", \"0.93\", \"0.98\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"HellaSwag\", \"0.68\", \"0.80\", \"0.93\", \"0.98\", \"0.99\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"HellaSwag\", \"0.60\", \"0.72\", \"0.84\", \"0.95\", \"0.99\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"HellaSwag\", \"0.66\", \"0.78\", \"0.91\", \"0.97\", \"0.99\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B\", \"HellaSwag\", \"0.65\", \"0.77\", \"0.90\", \"0.97\", \"0.99\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"GSM8K\", \"0.55\", \"0.63\", \"0.76\", \"0.88\", \"0.95\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"GSM8K\", \"0.52\", \"0.58\", \"0.67\", \"0.82\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"GSM8K\", \"0.54\", \"0.62\", \"0.74\", \"0.87\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B\", \"GSM8K\", \"0.53\", \"0.60\", \"0.71\", \"0.85\", \"0.93\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cohen's d for Δlz* (averaged across 4 models)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"5%\", \"10%\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"0.9\", \"1.4\", \"2.1\", \"3.8\", \"5.2\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"0.6\", \"1.0\", \"1.6\", \"3.0\", \"4.3\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"0.3\", \"0.5\", \"0.8\", \"1.5\", \"2.6\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Δlz* dose-response curves (4 models × 3 benchmarks). X-axis = contamination %, Y-axis = Δlz*. Each model a different color, each benchmark a panel. Shows monotonic decrease with model-specific offsets.\"\n      - \"Fig B: AUROC heatmap (model × benchmark) at 15% contamination. Color-coded green (>0.90), yellow (0.80-0.90), red (<0.80). MMLU column all green, GSM8K column mostly yellow/red.\"\n      - \"Fig C: ROC curves at 15% for MMLU (all 4 models overlaid). Demonstrates consistent high AUC with tight model-to-model variance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      控制实验建立了 ground-truth contamination→Δlz* 的 causal mapping。三个关键结论：\n      (1) MMLU 15% AUROC=0.94 验证 headline claim，min_detectable ~10%（best 档 [5,15]）；\n      (2) power 与 n_items 的关系与 exp-power-theory 理论预测一致（R²>0.95），\n      GSM8K 的低 power 是 n_items=1319 的直接后果而非方法失效；\n      (3) 跨模型一致性 83% 满足 best 档，表明 SFT contamination signal 具有 architecture-invariant\n      的 universal aberrant pattern。这为 leaderboard audit 的外推提供了 validity evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Large-Scale Audit\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: >\n      扫描 Open LLM Leaderboard v1 全部可用模型的 per-item binary responses。\n      对每个模型计算 benchmark-specific lz*，建立 Δlz* 基于模型群体的 empirical distribution，\n      flag 异常模型。分析 contamination prevalence、temporal trends、model family clustering。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_total_downloaded: 12500\n      n_models_valid_after_qc: 11200\n      n_models_flagged_any_benchmark: 930\n      flagged_rate_overall: 0.083\n      flagged_rate_mmlu: 0.072\n      flagged_rate_hellaswag: 0.058\n      flagged_rate_arc_c: 0.045\n      flagged_rate_gsm8k: 0.091\n      n_flagged_2plus_benchmarks: 310\n      n_flagged_3plus_benchmarks: 85\n      temporal_trend_slope: \"+2.1pp/quarter\"\n      n_model_families_with_systematic_flagging: 12\n      top_flagged_family_rate: 0.35\n      gemini15_replication_lz_star: 31.8\n      compute_hours_total: 18\n      qc_exclusion_reasons: \"incomplete responses, <80% item coverage, duplicate submissions\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档需要 5000-13000 models analyzed 且 flagging pattern 有区分度。预测 11.2K 有效模型\n      （从 13K+ 中排除 QC 失败的），整体 flagging rate 8.3%：\n      \n      (1) Flagging 方法：因 universal misfit 不能用 absolute lz* thresholds，改用\n      population-based approach。对每个 benchmark，以所有模型的 lz* 构建 empirical distribution，\n      flag lz* 超过分布 2.5th/97.5th percentile 的模型。这给出 ~5% base flagging rate。\n      但进一步要求 flagged model 的 |Δlz*| 相对于 ability-matched peers（θ±0.5 bin）\n      超过 2 SD，使 false positive 降低但 true contamination（尤其 memorization-style）\n      仍被捕获。最终 ~8.3% 被 flag。\n      \n      (2) 8.3% 而非更高：Leaderboard 上多数模型是 honest submissions（community models、\n      research checkpoints），真正 benchmark-gaming 的是少数。但 8.3% 仍代表 ~930 模型，\n      这些多为刻意优化 leaderboard score 的 submissions（fine-tuned on benchmark data）。\n      \n      (3) GSM8K flagging rate 最高（9.1%）看似矛盾（n_items 小，power 低），但原因不同：\n      GSM8K 的 training data 广泛泄露（已知 issue），且其 chain-of-thought format 使\n      SFT 污染效果特别显著（accuracy 跳升更 dramatic），即使 n_items 小，aberrance 也强。\n      \n      (4) Temporal trend +2.1pp/quarter：随着 benchmark gaming 意识增强和 training pipeline\n      自动化，later submissions 更可能包含 benchmark data。这与 community anecdotal evidence\n      一致。\n      \n      (5) 12 个 model families with systematic flagging：某些 org 的多个 model variants\n      共享 contaminated training data，产生 correlated flagging pattern。Top family 35%\n      flagging rate 意味着该 org 的 1/3 submissions 被 flag。\n      \n      (6) Gemini-1.5 replication：Phase B 的 lz*=31.8 在大规模 audit 中 confirmed，\n      且 context 更丰富——相对于 11K 模型的分布，Gemini-1.5 是 extreme outlier。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Leaderboard Audit Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_valid\", \"n_flagged\", \"Flag%\", \"Mean |lz*| flagged\", \"Mean |lz*| unflagged\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"11200\", \"806\", \"7.2%\", \"28.4\", \"16.2\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"11200\", \"650\", \"5.8%\", \"24.1\", \"14.8\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", \"11200\", \"504\", \"4.5%\", \"8.7\", \"4.2\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"11200\", \"1019\", \"9.1%\", \"6.9\", \"3.1\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Flagging\"\n        columns: [\"# Benchmarks Flagged\", \"n_models\", \"%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0\", \"10270\", \"91.7%\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"620\", \"5.5%\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"225\", \"2.0%\"]\n          - [\"3\", \"70\", \"0.6%\"]\n          - [\"4\", \"15\", \"0.1%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Temporal Trend (quarterly)\"\n        columns: [\"Period\", \"n_submissions\", \"Flag%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2023-Q3\", \"1800\", \"4.2%\"]\n          - [\"2023-Q4\", \"2900\", \"6.5%\"]\n          - [\"2024-Q1\", \"3200\", \"9.1%\"]\n          - [\"2024-Q2\", \"3300\", \"11.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: lz* distribution (violin) per benchmark for 11K models. Flagged models highlighted in red. Shows the population-level distribution with flagged outliers.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Temporal contamination prevalence. Line plot of quarterly flag rate with 95% CI band. Clear upward trend.\"\n      - \"Fig C: Model family clustering heatmap. Rows = top 20 orgs by submission count, columns = benchmarks, cells = flag rate. Reveals systematic contamination at org level.\"\n      - \"Fig D: Scatter of θ vs lz* for MMLU, 11K models. Flagged models colored red. Demonstrates that flagging is NOT simply high-ability models — contaminated models appear at various ability levels.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Leaderboard audit 是论文最大 differentiator。11.2K 模型的 scale 远超任何现有 contamination\n      study。8.3% overall flagging 转化为 headline \"systematic contamination patterns in\n      8.3% of submissions\"。关键 publication-ready findings：(1) contamination prevalence\n      随时间上升，corroborating community concerns；(2) model-family clustering 提供\n      actionable intelligence（specific orgs）；(3) multi-benchmark flagging 提高\n      specificity——被 3+ benchmarks flag 的 85 个模型是 high-confidence contaminated。\n      (4) GSM8K 最高 flag rate 与已知数据泄露一致，提供 external validity。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: >\n      固定 d=1（3PL）重新计算所有 lz*，与 4PL 结果对比 detection sensitivity。\n      在 simulation 和 real data 两个层面评估。\n    expected_results:\n      sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.96\n      sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.978\n      sim_power_diff_mmlu_15pct: -0.018\n      sim_power_3pl_gsm8k_15pct: 0.54\n      sim_power_4pl_gsm8k_15pct: 0.59\n      real_data_lz_star_correlation_4pl_3pl: 0.97\n      false_alarm_rate_change: \"+1.2pp\"\n      cohen_d_ratio_3pl_over_4pl: 0.93\n      key_finding: \"4PL 提供 marginal but consistent improvement; d≠1 的 benchmarks 受益更多\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      d parameter（upper asymptote / feasibility parameter）对大多数 well-designed benchmark\n      items 接近 1.0，因为高能力者应能答对绝大多数题。但 LLM 评估中存在 format sensitivity、\n      prompt sensitivity 等因素导致部分 items d < 1（即使\"最聪明\"的模型也无法 100% 答对）。\n      \n      在 best 档下，4PL vs 3PL 差异 marginal（MMLU power diff = -1.8pp）因为：\n      (a) MMLU items 多数 d 接近 1.0（well-calibrated MCQ），3PL 近似足够好；\n      (b) lz* 的计算对 d 不是特别敏感，因为 d 影响的是 high-ability region 的 expected\n      probability，而 lz* 是 across all items 的 aggregate；\n      (c) correlation 0.97 说明 rank-order 基本不变。\n      但 GSM8K 上差异略大（-5pp），因为 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 解题有更多 d < 1 items\n      （格式错误导致正确推理被判错）。4PL 通过 fitting d < 1 避免将这些 items 的 \"miss\"\n      错误归因为 low ability，减少 residual noise，提高 lz* 的 discrimination。\n      整体结论：4PL 是 strictly better 但 improvement 不 dramatic，支持方法论选择但不改变主要结论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"Level\", \"Power(4PL)\", \"Power(3PL)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"15%\", \"0.978\", \"0.960\", \"-0.018\"]\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"50%\", \"0.953\", \"0.941\", \"-0.012\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"15%\", \"0.753\", \"0.730\", \"-0.023\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"15%\", \"0.591\", \"0.540\", \"-0.051\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", \"15%\", \"0.129\", \"0.118\", \"-0.011\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot of lz*(4PL) vs lz*(3PL) for all 60 real-data cells. Near-perfect correlation (r=0.97) with slight systematic offset for models with many d<1 items.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ablation 确认 4PL 是 principled default choice，但差异小到 reviewer 不需要担心\n      参数化选择对结论的影响。这直接回应 R8 concern。写入 paper 作为 appendix ablation。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Method Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      在 exp-ctrl-contam 的 ground-truth contaminated models 上，对比 IRT-FIT (lz*-based\n      AUROC) vs Min-K%++ (token probabilities) vs ConStat (re-test consistency)。\n      量化 minimal-information operating point 的 power cost。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU 15% contamination\n      auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_15pct: 0.94\n      auroc_minkpp_mmlu_15pct: 0.97\n      auroc_constat_mmlu_15pct: 0.99\n      auroc_gap_irt_vs_minkpp_mmlu_15pct: -0.03\n      auroc_gap_irt_vs_constat_mmlu_15pct: -0.05\n      # MMLU 50%\n      auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_50pct: 1.00\n      auroc_minkpp_mmlu_50pct: 1.00\n      auroc_constat_mmlu_50pct: 1.00\n      # HellaSwag 15%\n      auroc_irt_fit_hswag_15pct: 0.90\n      auroc_minkpp_hswag_15pct: 0.95\n      auroc_constat_hswag_15pct: 0.97\n      # GSM8K 15%\n      auroc_irt_fit_gsm8k_15pct: 0.72\n      auroc_minkpp_gsm8k_15pct: 0.81\n      auroc_constat_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n      # Averaged gap\n      baseline_auroc_gap_avg: -0.06\n      # Type-I error at α=0.05\n      type1_irt_fit: 0.058\n      type1_minkpp: 0.047\n      type1_constat: 0.052\n      key_finding: \"IRT-FIT AUROC averages 5-6pp below gray-box methods, well within best-档 [-0.10, -0.02] range\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 baseline_auroc_gap [-0.10, -0.02]。预测 average gap = -0.06：\n      \n      (1) Min-K%++ 使用 token-level probabilities（gray-box access），天然信息量大于\n      binary responses。它能检测 \"training data 中出现过\" 的 statistical signature，\n      即使不产生 aberrant response pattern 也可检测。因此 AUROC 通常高于 IRT-FIT。\n      但 gap 仅 -3pp on MMLU 因为 SFT contamination 产生的 aberrance 在 binary patterns\n      中已足够显著（MMLU 14K items 放大信号）。在 GSM8K 上 gap 更大（-9pp）因为\n      n_items=1319 下 binary signal 弱，但 token probabilities 不受 n_items 限制。\n      \n      (2) ConStat 使用 re-test（rephrased questions），信息量最大——直接测试 \"是否理解\n      concept vs 记住 answer\"。AUROC consistently highest。但它需要额外推理 pass\n      （rephrased test），实际 cost 远高于 IRT-FIT 和 Min-K%++。\n      \n      (3) 关键 narrative：gap 仅 5-6pp 意味着从 full token probabilities 到 binary\n      responses 的信息损失 surprisingly small。这 validates minimal-information operating\n      point 的 practical value——在无法获得 logits/weights 的场景（closed-source models、\n      leaderboard submissions），IRT-FIT 的 performance-to-access-cost ratio 最优。\n      \n      (4) Type-I error 均 well-controlled（≈0.05），说明三种方法在 clean models 上都\n      calibrated。IRT-FIT 略高（0.058）因为 universal misfit 增加 boundary cases 的\n      variance，但远未失控。\n      \n      (5) 在 50% contamination 下所有方法 AUROC=1.0，说明 heavy contamination 是\n      trivially detectable regardless of method。差异仅在 low-contamination regime 显现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC Comparison (Benchmark × Method)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"Level\", \"IRT-FIT\", \"Min-K%++\", \"ConStat\", \"Δ(IRT-best)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"15%\", \"0.94\", \"0.97\", \"0.99\", \"-0.05\"]\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"50%\", \"1.00\", \"1.00\", \"1.00\", \"0.00\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"15%\", \"0.90\", \"0.95\", \"0.97\", \"-0.07\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"15%\", \"0.72\", \"0.81\", \"0.88\", \"-0.16\"]\n          - [\"Average\", \"15%\", \"0.85\", \"0.91\", \"0.95\", \"-0.09\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Information Access Requirements\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Access Level\", \"Binary\", \"Token Probs\", \"Re-test\", \"Scalability\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT\", \"Minimal\", \"✓\", \"✗\", \"✗\", \"13K+ models (offline)\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Gray-box\", \"✓\", \"✓\", \"✗\", \"Live model access required\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"Re-test\", \"✓\", \"✗\", \"✓\", \"2× inference cost per model\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: ROC curves (3 methods) on MMLU 15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve slightly below but close to Min-K%++ and ConStat.\"\n      - \"Fig B: AUROC gap (IRT-FIT minus best baseline) as function of n_items. Shows gap shrinks with larger benchmarks — converges for n>10K.\"\n      - \"Fig C: Detection frontier diagram — Y-axis = AUROC, X-axis = information access level (binary → token probs → re-test → logits → weights). IRT-FIT defines the leftmost point.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline comparison 完成 detection frontier framing 的 empirical support。\n      Average AUROC gap -0.06 在 best 档 [-0.10, -0.02] 内，headline: \"IRT-FIT achieves\n      94% of the best method's performance using only binary responses.\" 更重要的是\n      scalability argument: Min-K%++ 和 ConStat 无法应用于 leaderboard 的 13K archived\n      submissions（无 live model access），IRT-FIT 是唯一能做大规模 retrospective audit 的方法。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Statistic\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: >\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 lzm 统计量：跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz*，\n      提供 per-model 的 overall contamination index。在 Phase B 12 模型 + 控制实验模型上验证。\n    expected_results:\n      lzm_gemini15: 42.3\n      lzm_gemini15_p: \"<1e-10\"\n      lzm_correlation_with_mean_lz_star: 0.96\n      lzm_improves_cross_benchmark_detection: true\n      lzm_auroc_improvement_over_per_benchmark: \"+3-5pp\"\n      n_phase_b_models_flagged_by_lzm: 11\n      ctrl_contam_lzm_auroc_15pct: 0.96\n      ctrl_contam_lzm_auroc_5pct: 0.83\n      key_finding: \"lzm provides marginal AUROC improvement (+4pp at 15%) by aggregating cross-benchmark signal\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      lzm 是多个 benchmark 的 lz* 的标准化加权和，理论上通过聚合独立信号提高 power。\n      \n      (1) Improvement marginal (+3-5pp) 而非 dramatic 因为：MMLU 的 lz* 已经 dominant\n      （14K items 提供最强 signal），lzm 的额外 power 主要来自 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 的\n      complementary signal。当 MMLU 信号已很强时，aggregation 的 marginal gain 有限\n      （diminishing returns）。\n      \n      (2) 但在 MMLU 单独 power 不足的 low-contamination regime（5%），lzm 的 cross-benchmark\n      aggregation 更有价值（AUROC 从 ~0.78 到 0.83），因为多个 weak signals 合并后\n      超过 detection threshold。\n      \n      (3) Correlation 0.96 with mean lz* 说明 lzm 本质上是 weighted average 的\n      formal version，但它提供了 proper statistical inference（p-value, CI）而 mean lz*\n      没有。\n      \n      (4) Phase B 11/12 flagged（vs 之前全部 flagged）：lzm 的标准化使得一个模型\n      （能力最低、各 benchmark 都差但不 aberrant）脱离 flagging zone。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lzm vs per-benchmark Detection\"\n        columns: [\"Level\", \"AUROC(best single)\", \"AUROC(lzm)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", \"0.78 (MMLU)\", \"0.83\", \"+0.05\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.94 (MMLU)\", \"0.96\", \"+0.02\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"0.99 (MMLU)\", \"0.99\", \"+0.00\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: lzm score distribution for Phase B 12 models. Gemini-1.5 as extreme outlier (lzm=42.3). Other flagged models clustered around lzm=15-25.\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 作为 supplementary statistic 有价值但不改变主要结论。写入 paper 作为 Section 5.3\n      的 cross-benchmark aggregation method。最大 value 是为 Claim 3 的 \"model-level\n      contamination profile\" 提供 formal single-number summary。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 注入 15%/50% MMLU contamination，然后 GRPO 训练 2-3 epochs\n      （rule-based reward on held-out tasks），测试 person-fit signal 在 RL 后是否保留。\n      直接回应 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA 失效问题。\n    expected_results:\n      # Pre-RL (SFT only) — from exp-ctrl-contam\n      pre_rl_delta_lz_15pct: -4.6\n      pre_rl_delta_lz_50pct: -13.1\n      # Post-RL\n      post_rl_delta_lz_15pct: -2.9\n      post_rl_delta_lz_50pct: -9.2\n      signal_retention_15pct: 0.63\n      signal_retention_50pct: 0.70\n      post_rl_auroc_15pct: 0.88\n      post_rl_auroc_50pct: 0.97\n      # MIA comparison\n      mia_minkpp_auroc_post_rl_15pct: 0.58\n      mia_minkpp_auroc_post_rl_50pct: 0.64\n      accuracy_change_post_rl_contam_items: -0.02\n      accuracy_change_post_rl_clean_items: +0.03\n      key_finding: \"62-70% of Δlz* signal retained post-RL; Min-K%++ drops to near-chance (AUROC 0.58)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 signal_retention [0.4, 0.8]。预测 63%/70%：\n      \n      (1) RL（GRPO）通过 policy gradient 优化 reward，不直接 target memorized items 的\n      parameter space。SFT 产生的 contamination 存储在模型的 specific parameter subspace\n      （QLoRA 的 adapter weights），GRPO 主要调整 policy 的 general behavior patterns\n      （format compliance, reasoning style），对 adapter weights 的 perturbation 是 indirect\n      且 partial。因此 majority of aberrant pattern 保留。\n      \n      (2) 保留 63% 而非 90%+：GRPO 确实会 smooth out 一些 over-confident predictions\n      on contaminated items（RL 的 KL penalty 抑制极端 probability），导致部分 aberrant\n      signal 削弱。且 RL 在 clean tasks 上的 general improvement（+3pp accuracy）\n      slightly raises baseline，缩小 Δlz*。\n      \n      (3) 50% contamination 保留率更高（70% vs 63%）：信号更强，RL 的 smoothing effect\n      按比例影响更小（absolute Δlz* 大，relative reduction 小）。\n      \n      (4) Min-K%++ AUROC 暴跌到 0.58（near chance）：这正是 Wang et al. (2025) 的发现。\n      MIA 方法依赖 token-level probability patterns that are characteristic of training data，\n      RL 重新分配了 token probability mass（reward-optimized generation ≠ SFT memorization），\n      破坏了 MIA 的 detection signal。但 IRT-FIT 的 binary response pattern 更 robust：\n      只要 contaminated items 仍被答对（accuracy 仅降 2pp），aberrant pattern 就存在。\n      \n      (5) 这个对比是论文最强 selling point 之一：\"IRT-FIT retains 63% detection power\n      post-RL where token-level methods fail (AUROC 0.58 vs 0.88)\"，直接回应领域的\n      open problem。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"15% contam\", \"50% contam\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Δlz* pre-RL\", \"-4.6\", \"-13.1\"]\n          - [\"Δlz* post-RL\", \"-2.9\", \"-9.2\"]\n          - [\"Retention\", \"63%\", \"70%\"]\n          - [\"AUROC pre-RL\", \"0.94\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"AUROC post-RL\", \"0.88\", \"0.97\"]\n      - name: \"Table: IRT-FIT vs Min-K%++ Post-RL\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"AUROC pre-RL (15%)\", \"AUROC post-RL (15%)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT (binary)\", \"0.94\", \"0.88\", \"-0.06\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++ (token probs)\", \"0.97\", \"0.58\", \"-0.39\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Bar chart of AUROC pre-RL vs post-RL for IRT-FIT and Min-K%++. IRT-FIT bar barely changes; Min-K%++ collapses.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Δlz* trajectory through SFT→RL training. X-axis = training stage (clean → SFT → RL epoch 1 → RL epoch 2 → RL epoch 3). Shows gradual partial recovery but majority of signal retained.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 实验提供 Wang et al. (2025) 的直接 rebuttal。IRT-FIT 的 robustness 来自\n      fundamental difference in signal type：binary pattern aberrance vs token probability\n      memorization signature。这是 paper 的 strongest \"additional contribution\"，\n      升级为 main-body result（非 appendix）。\n\n  - name: \"Extended Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: >\n      添加 BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n      获取或校准 4PL 参数，运行 simulation + 控制实验验证。\n    expected_results:\n      bbh_n_items: 6511\n      math_n_items: 5000\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.87\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.78\n      bbh_ctrl_auroc_15pct: 0.85\n      math_ctrl_auroc_15pct: 0.76\n      power_theory_R2_with_new_benchmarks: 0.97\n      bbh_dual_regime_crossover: \"78-83%\"\n      math_dual_regime_crossover: \"80-85%\"\n      key_finding: \"BBH and MATH fill the 1K-10K gap, confirming power∝sqrt(n) theory with R²=0.97\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      BBH (6.5K items) 和 MATH (5K items) 填充 GSM8K(1.3K) 和 HellaSwag(10K) 之间的空白。\n      \n      (1) BBH power 0.87 at 15%：n=6511 接近但低于 exp-power-theory 的 min_items_15pct_80power\n      =7958 阈值。But 超过 80% 因为 BBH items 的 difficulty distribution 比 MMLU 更 dispersed\n      （包含 very hard reasoning tasks），提供 more discriminating power per item。\n      \n      (2) MATH power 0.78 at 15%：n=5000 更远低于 7958 阈值，且 MATH 的 items 有 high\n      inter-correlation（数学推理 chains share common skills），violating local independence\n      更严重，effective n_items < nominal 5000。但 0.78 仍接近 0.80 可用阈值。\n      \n      (3) 理论 R² 从 0.9572 升至 0.97：新增 2 个 data points 正好在 theory gap region，\n      且 actual power 与 sqrt(n) 预测 well-aligned，tightening the fit。这是 Claim 2 的\n      strongest evidence——power function 不仅理论成立，在 7 个 benchmarks 上 empirically\n      验证。\n      \n      (4) Dual-regime crossover 在 78-85% 范围，与其他 benchmarks 一致，confirming\n      crossover 是 benchmark-invariant property（由 IRT model 结构决定，不依赖 specific items）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Power Function Across 7 Benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Sim Power@15%\", \"Ctrl AUROC@15%\", \"Theory Pred\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"14042\", \"0.978\", \"0.94\", \"0.97\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"10042\", \"0.753\", \"0.90\", \"0.89\"]\n          - [\"BBH\", \"6511\", \"0.87\", \"0.85\", \"0.84\"]\n          - [\"MATH\", \"5000\", \"0.78\", \"0.76\", \"0.79\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"1319\", \"0.591\", \"0.72\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", \"1172\", \"0.129\", \"—\", \"0.48\"]\n          - [\"HumanEval\", \"164\", \"0.243\", \"—\", \"0.18\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power vs sqrt(n_items) with 7 benchmarks. Theoretical curve (solid line) with empirical points. BBH and MATH fall right on the curve, eliminating the previous gap.\"\n    analysis: >\n      BBH 和 MATH 将 Claim 2 的 empirical support 从 5 benchmarks 扩展到 7，且关键地填充了\n      1K-10K region。R²=0.97 使 \"power is a predictable function of n_items\" 从 claim 升级为\n      near-law。\n\n  - name: \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 MMLU 57 subjects × 4 categories 分别计算 person-fit，识别 contamination 的\n      domain specificity。在 Phase B (Gemini-1.5) 和控制实验模型上运行。\n    expected_results:\n      n_mmlu_subjects: 57\n      n_mmlu_categories: 4\n      gemini15_flagged_subjects: 57\n      gemini15_domain_variance: \"low (all uniformly extreme)\"\n      ctrl_contam_domain_concentration: \"high — contamination signal concentrated in contaminated-item subjects\"\n      ctrl_contam_non_contam_domain_lz_change: \"<0.3 SD\"\n      ctrl_contam_contam_domain_lz_change: \">2.0 SD\"\n      domain_level_auroc_mmlu_15pct: 0.82\n      domain_level_specificity_advantage: \"identifies which subjects were contaminated\"\n      key_finding: \"Domain-level analysis reveals contamination is localized — Δlz* concentrates in contaminated subject areas with minimal spillover\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) Gemini-1.5 的 domain analysis 不 informative：acc=1.000 意味着所有 57 subjects\n      全部 100%，所以 lz* 在每个 domain 都 extreme。这 confirms \"full contamination\"\n      但不 reveals selectivity。\n      \n      (2) 控制实验的 domain analysis 才是关键发现：SFT 注入 15% random items，这些 items\n      分布在多个 subjects 中。Domain-level lz* 变化应 concentrate 在 contaminated items\n      密度高的 subjects（因 random sampling，大 subjects 贡献更多 contaminated items）。\n      \n      (3) Non-contaminated domains 的 lz* 变化 <0.3 SD：SFT 的 generalization 在 best 档\n      下有限。QLoRA 的 low-rank update 主要 memorize exact items 而非 transfer to related\n      items。这是 best 档核心假设 \"SFT 污染产生局部异常模式为主，泛化效应有限\" 的直接验证。\n      \n      (4) Domain-level AUROC 0.82（低于 whole-benchmark 0.94）：per-domain n_items 更小\n      （MMLU 57 subjects 平均 ~246 items/subject），power 降低。但仍超过 0.80，提供\n      subject-level contamination localization 能力。\n      \n      (5) 这个分析回应 R5 (\"SFT generalization smooths signal\")：empirical evidence 表明\n      SFT contamination 不 generalize，lz* signal 是 localized 的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Domain-Level Δlz* (Controlled Experiment, 15% contamination, averaged)\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"n_subjects\", \"Avg Δlz* (contam subjects)\", \"Avg Δlz* (clean subjects)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"STEM\", \"18\", \"-3.8\", \"-0.2\"]\n          - [\"Humanities\", \"13\", \"-4.1\", \"-0.1\"]\n          - [\"Social Sciences\", \"12\", \"-3.5\", \"-0.3\"]\n          - [\"Other\", \"14\", \"-3.9\", \"-0.2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Heatmap of Δlz* by subject (57 rows) × model (4 columns). Contaminated subjects show clear dark bands; clean subjects remain near zero.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Histogram of per-subject Δlz* split by contaminated (red) vs clean (blue) subjects. Clear bimodal separation.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain analysis 提供 contamination localization — 不仅检测 \"是否污染\" 还能指出\n      \"哪些 subjects 被污染\"。这是 IRT-FIT 相对于 model-level methods 的 unique capability，\n      因为 item-level response pattern 天然支持 disaggregation。写入 paper Section 5.4。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14775,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14775},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b274d9b3-3643-46ca-a844-af844970b704","uuid":"ceb5d56e-46ad-43a0-8213-895bcaeb9e1c"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":294262,"duration_api_ms":301181,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Headline: \"Using only binary responses, IRT-FIT detects 15% SFT\n  contamination on MMLU with AUROC 0.94; a 13K-model leaderboard audit reveals systematic\n  contamination patterns in 8.3% of submissions.\" 三条 Claims 以强形式陈述。Claim 1 由控制实验\n  验证——Δlz* Cohen's d=2.1 在 MMLU 15% 污染，well-calibrated null 上统计显著，universal model\n  misfit 不妨碍 within-model detection。Claim 2 的 power function + dual-regime 由理论推导、\n  扩展模拟和控制实验三重支撑，BBH/MATH 填补 1K-10K gap。Claim 3 的 leaderboard audit 分析 11K+ 模型，\n  发现 time-correlated contamination waves 和 model-family clustering，从 exploratory 升级为\n  validated large-scale application。Post-RL 信号保留 62% 成为额外亮点，直接回应 Wang et al. (2025)。\n  Baseline 对比显示 IRT-FIT AUROC 仅低于 Min-K%++ 5pp，但在 minimal-information 条件下实现，\n  cost-benefit 极优。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B × 3 levels (0%/15%/50%) × MMLU only。QLoRA SFT 注入指定比例 MMLU items，\n      评估全 14K items 的 binary responses，计算 lz* 并与 clean baseline 对比 Δlz*。\n      Go/no-go gate for 整个控制实验线。\n    expected_results:\n      clean_lz_star_mean: -18.5\n      clean_lz_star_std: 2.3\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_mean: -23.1\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_std: 2.8\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_mean: -31.6\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_std: 3.1\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_mean: -4.6\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_cohen_d: 1.8\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_mean: -13.1\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_cohen_d: 4.7\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_p_value: \"<1e-4\"\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_p_value: \"<1e-8\"\n      accuracy_gain_15pct: 0.04\n      accuracy_gain_50pct: 0.12\n      n_runs_per_level: 3\n      go_nogo: \"GO\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Clean Qwen3.5-9B 在 MMLU 上已有极端负 lz*（universal misfit），约 -18 到 -19。\n      15% SFT 污染注入 ~2100 items 的 correct answers，这些 items 中包含大量 high-difficulty\n      items（θ_item > θ_model），模型原本会答错但 SFT 后答对。这种 \"答对不该答对的难题\" 模式\n      正是 lz* 设计要捕捉的 aberrance——在 IRT 框架下等价于考生有 preknowledge。由于 MMLU 有\n      14K items，~2100 contaminated items 产生的 aberrant signal 在 lz* 的 sum-of-residuals\n      结构中累积为显著负向偏移。Cohen's d=1.8 处于 best 档 [1.5, 3.0] 范围内，因为：\n      (a) MMLU n_items=14K 使 lz* 方差较小（Var(lz*)∝1/n），放大标准化效应量；\n      (b) SFT 在 QLoRA 下产生 localized parameter changes，contaminated items 的 accuracy\n      接近 1.0 而 non-contaminated items 变化微小，产生清晰的 aberrant pattern；\n      (c) 3 runs 的 seed 变异主要来自 SFT 随机性，不足以淹没 signal。\n      50% 污染效应更强（d=4.7）因为 ~7000 contaminated items 占半数以上，aberrance 信号\n      接近 saturation。Accuracy gain 较温和（+4pp at 15%）因为 SFT 主要影响 contaminated items\n      中原本答错的子集（~40-60% of contaminated items），而非全部。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pilot Δlz* Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Level\", \"lz*_mean\", \"lz*_std\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p (paired t)\", \"Acc\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0% (clean)\", \"-18.5\", \"2.3\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"0.63\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"-23.1\", \"2.8\", \"-4.6\", \"1.8\", \"<1e-4\", \"0.67\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"-31.6\", \"3.1\", \"-13.1\", \"4.7\", \"<1e-8\", \"0.75\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Pilot lz* distribution (3 seeds × 3 levels). Violin plot 显示 clean→15%→50% 的 lz* 下移趋势，with individual run points overlaid.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pilot 确认 go/no-go: Δlz* 在 15% 已统计显著，Cohen's d=1.8 表明 effect size large。\n      关键观察：(1) clean baseline 的 lz* 已极端（-18.5），confirm universal misfit；\n      (2) 但 within-model Δlz* 仍可分离，因为 contamination 产生的 aberrance 叠加在 misfit 之上；\n      (3) accuracy gain 温和说明 lz* 捕捉的是 pattern anomaly 而非 performance boost。\n      这为 full exp-ctrl-contam 提供强 go signal。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      4 模型 (Qwen3.5-9B, Gemma-4-31B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) ×\n      6 levels (0%/5%/10%/15%/25%/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU, GSM8K, HellaSwag)。\n      QLoRA SFT 注入，每 setting 3 seeds。建立 ground-truth contamination→Δlz* 映射。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU results (n=14042)\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_5pct: 0.9\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_10pct: 1.4\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 2.1\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct: 3.8\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct: 5.2\n      mmlu_auroc_5pct: 0.78\n      mmlu_auroc_10pct: 0.87\n      mmlu_auroc_15pct: 0.94\n      mmlu_auroc_25pct: 0.99\n      mmlu_auroc_50pct: 1.0\n      # HellaSwag results (n=10042)\n      hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 1.6\n      hellaswag_auroc_15pct: 0.90\n      hellaswag_auroc_50pct: 0.99\n      # GSM8K results (n=1319)\n      gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 0.8\n      gsm8k_auroc_15pct: 0.72\n      gsm8k_auroc_50pct: 0.93\n      # Cross-model consistency\n      cross_model_detectable_frac_mmlu_15pct: 1.0\n      cross_model_detectable_frac_hellaswag_15pct: 0.75\n      cross_model_detectable_frac_gsm8k_15pct: 0.50\n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_15pct: 0.83\n      overall_detectable_frac_all_cells: 0.85\n      min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct: 10\n      min_detectable_contam_hellaswag_pct: 15\n      min_detectable_contam_gsm8k_pct: 25\n      n_total_cells: 72\n      n_detectable_cells_15pct: 10/12\n    result_rationale: >\n      MMLU 结果最强，因 n_items=14042 是三个 benchmark 中最大的。根据 exp-power-theory 的\n      sqrt(n) 关系，lz* 的 discrimination power ∝ sqrt(n_items)：MMLU(14K) > HellaSwag(10K)\n      > GSM8K(1.3K)。在 best 档下：\n      \n      (1) MMLU 15% AUROC=0.94：4 模型全部可检测（4/4），因为 14K items 下即使最弱模型\n      (Mistral-7B) 的 Δlz* 也足够显著。Cohen's d=2.1 处于 best 档 [1.5,3.0] 中部，反映\n      SFT contamination 的 localized effect——contaminated items 上 accuracy 跳升但\n      non-contaminated items 基本不变，IRT residuals 在 contaminated subset 上系统偏离。\n      5% contamination 在 MMLU 上已可部分检测（AUROC=0.78），因为 ~700 items 的信号在\n      14K-item 的 lz* 中仍可累积。min_detectable 约 10%（AUROC>0.80 门槛）。\n      \n      (2) HellaSwag 15% AUROC=0.90：n=10K 提供足够 power 但低于 MMLU。3/4 模型可检测，\n      Gemma-4-31B 可能因较高 baseline ability (θ接近 ceiling) 导致 contamination 的\n      marginal effect 较小。HellaSwag 的 completion-style format 使 SFT 记忆效果\n      slightly less localized than MMLU MCQ。\n      \n      (3) GSM8K 15% AUROC=0.72：n=1319 严重限制 power。根据 exp-power-theory 的\n      min_items_15pct_80power=7958，GSM8K 远低于此阈值。仅 2/4 模型在 15% 可检测。\n      但 50% 时 AUROC 升至 0.93，因为 ~660 contaminated items 的信号终于足够强。\n      \n      (4) 跨模型一致性 0.83（10/12 cells at 15%）满足 best 档 [0.8, 1.0]：MMLU 全部\n      通过，HellaSwag 3/4，GSM8K 对 best 档贡献 1/4（仅最大模型 Gemma 可检测）。\n      一致性好的根本原因是 SFT contamination 产生的 aberrant pattern 与模型架构无关——\n      它本质上是 \"在特定 items 上 accuracy 跳升\" 的 universal signature。\n      \n      (5) 模型间 Cohen's d 变异适中（CV~20%）：Qwen 和 Llama 效应最强（较低 baseline\n      ability，contamination marginal gain 大），Gemma 最弱（高 baseline，部分\n      contaminated items 本就能答对）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC by Model × Benchmark × Level\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Benchmark\", \"5%\", \"10%\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"MMLU\", \"0.81\", \"0.90\", \"0.96\", \"0.99\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"MMLU\", \"0.74\", \"0.84\", \"0.91\", \"0.98\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"MMLU\", \"0.80\", \"0.89\", \"0.95\", \"0.99\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B\", \"MMLU\", \"0.76\", \"0.86\", \"0.93\", \"0.98\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"HellaSwag\", \"0.68\", \"0.80\", \"0.93\", \"0.98\", \"0.99\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"HellaSwag\", \"0.60\", \"0.72\", \"0.84\", \"0.95\", \"0.99\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"HellaSwag\", \"0.66\", \"0.78\", \"0.91\", \"0.97\", \"0.99\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B\", \"HellaSwag\", \"0.65\", \"0.77\", \"0.90\", \"0.97\", \"0.99\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"GSM8K\", \"0.55\", \"0.63\", \"0.76\", \"0.88\", \"0.95\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"GSM8K\", \"0.52\", \"0.58\", \"0.67\", \"0.82\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"GSM8K\", \"0.54\", \"0.62\", \"0.74\", \"0.87\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B\", \"GSM8K\", \"0.53\", \"0.60\", \"0.71\", \"0.85\", \"0.93\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cohen's d for Δlz* (averaged across 4 models)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"5%\", \"10%\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"0.9\", \"1.4\", \"2.1\", \"3.8\", \"5.2\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"0.6\", \"1.0\", \"1.6\", \"3.0\", \"4.3\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"0.3\", \"0.5\", \"0.8\", \"1.5\", \"2.6\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Δlz* dose-response curves (4 models × 3 benchmarks). X-axis = contamination %, Y-axis = Δlz*. Each model a different color, each benchmark a panel. Shows monotonic decrease with model-specific offsets.\"\n      - \"Fig B: AUROC heatmap (model × benchmark) at 15% contamination. Color-coded green (>0.90), yellow (0.80-0.90), red (<0.80). MMLU column all green, GSM8K column mostly yellow/red.\"\n      - \"Fig C: ROC curves at 15% for MMLU (all 4 models overlaid). Demonstrates consistent high AUC with tight model-to-model variance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      控制实验建立了 ground-truth contamination→Δlz* 的 causal mapping。三个关键结论：\n      (1) MMLU 15% AUROC=0.94 验证 headline claim，min_detectable ~10%（best 档 [5,15]）；\n      (2) power 与 n_items 的关系与 exp-power-theory 理论预测一致（R²>0.95），\n      GSM8K 的低 power 是 n_items=1319 的直接后果而非方法失效；\n      (3) 跨模型一致性 83% 满足 best 档，表明 SFT contamination signal 具有 architecture-invariant\n      的 universal aberrant pattern。这为 leaderboard audit 的外推提供了 validity evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Large-Scale Audit\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: >\n      扫描 Open LLM Leaderboard v1 全部可用模型的 per-item binary responses。\n      对每个模型计算 benchmark-specific lz*，建立 Δlz* 基于模型群体的 empirical distribution，\n      flag 异常模型。分析 contamination prevalence、temporal trends、model family clustering。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_total_downloaded: 12500\n      n_models_valid_after_qc: 11200\n      n_models_flagged_any_benchmark: 930\n      flagged_rate_overall: 0.083\n      flagged_rate_mmlu: 0.072\n      flagged_rate_hellaswag: 0.058\n      flagged_rate_arc_c: 0.045\n      flagged_rate_gsm8k: 0.091\n      n_flagged_2plus_benchmarks: 310\n      n_flagged_3plus_benchmarks: 85\n      temporal_trend_slope: \"+2.1pp/quarter\"\n      n_model_families_with_systematic_flagging: 12\n      top_flagged_family_rate: 0.35\n      gemini15_replication_lz_star: 31.8\n      compute_hours_total: 18\n      qc_exclusion_reasons: \"incomplete responses, <80% item coverage, duplicate submissions\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档需要 5000-13000 models analyzed 且 flagging pattern 有区分度。预测 11.2K 有效模型\n      （从 13K+ 中排除 QC 失败的），整体 flagging rate 8.3%：\n      \n      (1) Flagging 方法：因 universal misfit 不能用 absolute lz* thresholds，改用\n      population-based approach。对每个 benchmark，以所有模型的 lz* 构建 empirical distribution，\n      flag lz* 超过分布 2.5th/97.5th percentile 的模型。这给出 ~5% base flagging rate。\n      但进一步要求 flagged model 的 |Δlz*| 相对于 ability-matched peers（θ±0.5 bin）\n      超过 2 SD，使 false positive 降低但 true contamination（尤其 memorization-style）\n      仍被捕获。最终 ~8.3% 被 flag。\n      \n      (2) 8.3% 而非更高：Leaderboard 上多数模型是 honest submissions（community models、\n      research checkpoints），真正 benchmark-gaming 的是少数。但 8.3% 仍代表 ~930 模型，\n      这些多为刻意优化 leaderboard score 的 submissions（fine-tuned on benchmark data）。\n      \n      (3) GSM8K flagging rate 最高（9.1%）看似矛盾（n_items 小，power 低），但原因不同：\n      GSM8K 的 training data 广泛泄露（已知 issue），且其 chain-of-thought format 使\n      SFT 污染效果特别显著（accuracy 跳升更 dramatic），即使 n_items 小，aberrance 也强。\n      \n      (4) Temporal trend +2.1pp/quarter：随着 benchmark gaming 意识增强和 training pipeline\n      自动化，later submissions 更可能包含 benchmark data。这与 community anecdotal evidence\n      一致。\n      \n      (5) 12 个 model families with systematic flagging：某些 org 的多个 model variants\n      共享 contaminated training data，产生 correlated flagging pattern。Top family 35%\n      flagging rate 意味着该 org 的 1/3 submissions 被 flag。\n      \n      (6) Gemini-1.5 replication：Phase B 的 lz*=31.8 在大规模 audit 中 confirmed，\n      且 context 更丰富——相对于 11K 模型的分布，Gemini-1.5 是 extreme outlier。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Leaderboard Audit Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_valid\", \"n_flagged\", \"Flag%\", \"Mean |lz*| flagged\", \"Mean |lz*| unflagged\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"11200\", \"806\", \"7.2%\", \"28.4\", \"16.2\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"11200\", \"650\", \"5.8%\", \"24.1\", \"14.8\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", \"11200\", \"504\", \"4.5%\", \"8.7\", \"4.2\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"11200\", \"1019\", \"9.1%\", \"6.9\", \"3.1\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Flagging\"\n        columns: [\"# Benchmarks Flagged\", \"n_models\", \"%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0\", \"10270\", \"91.7%\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"620\", \"5.5%\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"225\", \"2.0%\"]\n          - [\"3\", \"70\", \"0.6%\"]\n          - [\"4\", \"15\", \"0.1%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Temporal Trend (quarterly)\"\n        columns: [\"Period\", \"n_submissions\", \"Flag%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2023-Q3\", \"1800\", \"4.2%\"]\n          - [\"2023-Q4\", \"2900\", \"6.5%\"]\n          - [\"2024-Q1\", \"3200\", \"9.1%\"]\n          - [\"2024-Q2\", \"3300\", \"11.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: lz* distribution (violin) per benchmark for 11K models. Flagged models highlighted in red. Shows the population-level distribution with flagged outliers.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Temporal contamination prevalence. Line plot of quarterly flag rate with 95% CI band. Clear upward trend.\"\n      - \"Fig C: Model family clustering heatmap. Rows = top 20 orgs by submission count, columns = benchmarks, cells = flag rate. Reveals systematic contamination at org level.\"\n      - \"Fig D: Scatter of θ vs lz* for MMLU, 11K models. Flagged models colored red. Demonstrates that flagging is NOT simply high-ability models — contaminated models appear at various ability levels.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Leaderboard audit 是论文最大 differentiator。11.2K 模型的 scale 远超任何现有 contamination\n      study。8.3% overall flagging 转化为 headline \"systematic contamination patterns in\n      8.3% of submissions\"。关键 publication-ready findings：(1) contamination prevalence\n      随时间上升，corroborating community concerns；(2) model-family clustering 提供\n      actionable intelligence（specific orgs）；(3) multi-benchmark flagging 提高\n      specificity——被 3+ benchmarks flag 的 85 个模型是 high-confidence contaminated。\n      (4) GSM8K 最高 flag rate 与已知数据泄露一致，提供 external validity。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: >\n      固定 d=1（3PL）重新计算所有 lz*，与 4PL 结果对比 detection sensitivity。\n      在 simulation 和 real data 两个层面评估。\n    expected_results:\n      sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.96\n      sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.978\n      sim_power_diff_mmlu_15pct: -0.018\n      sim_power_3pl_gsm8k_15pct: 0.54\n      sim_power_4pl_gsm8k_15pct: 0.59\n      real_data_lz_star_correlation_4pl_3pl: 0.97\n      false_alarm_rate_change: \"+1.2pp\"\n      cohen_d_ratio_3pl_over_4pl: 0.93\n      key_finding: \"4PL 提供 marginal but consistent improvement; d≠1 的 benchmarks 受益更多\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      d parameter（upper asymptote / feasibility parameter）对大多数 well-designed benchmark\n      items 接近 1.0，因为高能力者应能答对绝大多数题。但 LLM 评估中存在 format sensitivity、\n      prompt sensitivity 等因素导致部分 items d < 1（即使\"最聪明\"的模型也无法 100% 答对）。\n      \n      在 best 档下，4PL vs 3PL 差异 marginal（MMLU power diff = -1.8pp）因为：\n      (a) MMLU items 多数 d 接近 1.0（well-calibrated MCQ），3PL 近似足够好；\n      (b) lz* 的计算对 d 不是特别敏感，因为 d 影响的是 high-ability region 的 expected\n      probability，而 lz* 是 across all items 的 aggregate；\n      (c) correlation 0.97 说明 rank-order 基本不变。\n      但 GSM8K 上差异略大（-5pp），因为 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 解题有更多 d < 1 items\n      （格式错误导致正确推理被判错）。4PL 通过 fitting d < 1 避免将这些 items 的 \"miss\"\n      错误归因为 low ability，减少 residual noise，提高 lz* 的 discrimination。\n      整体结论：4PL 是 strictly better 但 improvement 不 dramatic，支持方法论选择但不改变主要结论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"Level\", \"Power(4PL)\", \"Power(3PL)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"15%\", \"0.978\", \"0.960\", \"-0.018\"]\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"50%\", \"0.953\", \"0.941\", \"-0.012\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"15%\", \"0.753\", \"0.730\", \"-0.023\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"15%\", \"0.591\", \"0.540\", \"-0.051\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", \"15%\", \"0.129\", \"0.118\", \"-0.011\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot of lz*(4PL) vs lz*(3PL) for all 60 real-data cells. Near-perfect correlation (r=0.97) with slight systematic offset for models with many d<1 items.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ablation 确认 4PL 是 principled default choice，但差异小到 reviewer 不需要担心\n      参数化选择对结论的影响。这直接回应 R8 concern。写入 paper 作为 appendix ablation。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Method Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      在 exp-ctrl-contam 的 ground-truth contaminated models 上，对比 IRT-FIT (lz*-based\n      AUROC) vs Min-K%++ (token probabilities) vs ConStat (re-test consistency)。\n      量化 minimal-information operating point 的 power cost。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU 15% contamination\n      auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_15pct: 0.94\n      auroc_minkpp_mmlu_15pct: 0.97\n      auroc_constat_mmlu_15pct: 0.99\n      auroc_gap_irt_vs_minkpp_mmlu_15pct: -0.03\n      auroc_gap_irt_vs_constat_mmlu_15pct: -0.05\n      # MMLU 50%\n      auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_50pct: 1.00\n      auroc_minkpp_mmlu_50pct: 1.00\n      auroc_constat_mmlu_50pct: 1.00\n      # HellaSwag 15%\n      auroc_irt_fit_hswag_15pct: 0.90\n      auroc_minkpp_hswag_15pct: 0.95\n      auroc_constat_hswag_15pct: 0.97\n      # GSM8K 15%\n      auroc_irt_fit_gsm8k_15pct: 0.72\n      auroc_minkpp_gsm8k_15pct: 0.81\n      auroc_constat_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n      # Averaged gap\n      baseline_auroc_gap_avg: -0.06\n      # Type-I error at α=0.05\n      type1_irt_fit: 0.058\n      type1_minkpp: 0.047\n      type1_constat: 0.052\n      key_finding: \"IRT-FIT AUROC averages 5-6pp below gray-box methods, well within best-档 [-0.10, -0.02] range\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 baseline_auroc_gap [-0.10, -0.02]。预测 average gap = -0.06：\n      \n      (1) Min-K%++ 使用 token-level probabilities（gray-box access），天然信息量大于\n      binary responses。它能检测 \"training data 中出现过\" 的 statistical signature，\n      即使不产生 aberrant response pattern 也可检测。因此 AUROC 通常高于 IRT-FIT。\n      但 gap 仅 -3pp on MMLU 因为 SFT contamination 产生的 aberrance 在 binary patterns\n      中已足够显著（MMLU 14K items 放大信号）。在 GSM8K 上 gap 更大（-9pp）因为\n      n_items=1319 下 binary signal 弱，但 token probabilities 不受 n_items 限制。\n      \n      (2) ConStat 使用 re-test（rephrased questions），信息量最大——直接测试 \"是否理解\n      concept vs 记住 answer\"。AUROC consistently highest。但它需要额外推理 pass\n      （rephrased test），实际 cost 远高于 IRT-FIT 和 Min-K%++。\n      \n      (3) 关键 narrative：gap 仅 5-6pp 意味着从 full token probabilities 到 binary\n      responses 的信息损失 surprisingly small。这 validates minimal-information operating\n      point 的 practical value——在无法获得 logits/weights 的场景（closed-source models、\n      leaderboard submissions），IRT-FIT 的 performance-to-access-cost ratio 最优。\n      \n      (4) Type-I error 均 well-controlled（≈0.05），说明三种方法在 clean models 上都\n      calibrated。IRT-FIT 略高（0.058）因为 universal misfit 增加 boundary cases 的\n      variance，但远未失控。\n      \n      (5) 在 50% contamination 下所有方法 AUROC=1.0，说明 heavy contamination 是\n      trivially detectable regardless of method。差异仅在 low-contamination regime 显现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC Comparison (Benchmark × Method)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"Level\", \"IRT-FIT\", \"Min-K%++\", \"ConStat\", \"Δ(IRT-best)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"15%\", \"0.94\", \"0.97\", \"0.99\", \"-0.05\"]\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"50%\", \"1.00\", \"1.00\", \"1.00\", \"0.00\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"15%\", \"0.90\", \"0.95\", \"0.97\", \"-0.07\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"15%\", \"0.72\", \"0.81\", \"0.88\", \"-0.16\"]\n          - [\"Average\", \"15%\", \"0.85\", \"0.91\", \"0.95\", \"-0.09\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Information Access Requirements\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Access Level\", \"Binary\", \"Token Probs\", \"Re-test\", \"Scalability\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT\", \"Minimal\", \"✓\", \"✗\", \"✗\", \"13K+ models (offline)\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Gray-box\", \"✓\", \"✓\", \"✗\", \"Live model access required\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"Re-test\", \"✓\", \"✗\", \"✓\", \"2× inference cost per model\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: ROC curves (3 methods) on MMLU 15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve slightly below but close to Min-K%++ and ConStat.\"\n      - \"Fig B: AUROC gap (IRT-FIT minus best baseline) as function of n_items. Shows gap shrinks with larger benchmarks — converges for n>10K.\"\n      - \"Fig C: Detection frontier diagram — Y-axis = AUROC, X-axis = information access level (binary → token probs → re-test → logits → weights). IRT-FIT defines the leftmost point.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline comparison 完成 detection frontier framing 的 empirical support。\n      Average AUROC gap -0.06 在 best 档 [-0.10, -0.02] 内，headline: \"IRT-FIT achieves\n      94% of the best method's performance using only binary responses.\" 更重要的是\n      scalability argument: Min-K%++ 和 ConStat 无法应用于 leaderboard 的 13K archived\n      submissions（无 live model access），IRT-FIT 是唯一能做大规模 retrospective audit 的方法。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Statistic\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: >\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 lzm 统计量：跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz*，\n      提供 per-model 的 overall contamination index。在 Phase B 12 模型 + 控制实验模型上验证。\n    expected_results:\n      lzm_gemini15: 42.3\n      lzm_gemini15_p: \"<1e-10\"\n      lzm_correlation_with_mean_lz_star: 0.96\n      lzm_improves_cross_benchmark_detection: true\n      lzm_auroc_improvement_over_per_benchmark: \"+3-5pp\"\n      n_phase_b_models_flagged_by_lzm: 11\n      ctrl_contam_lzm_auroc_15pct: 0.96\n      ctrl_contam_lzm_auroc_5pct: 0.83\n      key_finding: \"lzm provides marginal AUROC improvement (+4pp at 15%) by aggregating cross-benchmark signal\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      lzm 是多个 benchmark 的 lz* 的标准化加权和，理论上通过聚合独立信号提高 power。\n      \n      (1) Improvement marginal (+3-5pp) 而非 dramatic 因为：MMLU 的 lz* 已经 dominant\n      （14K items 提供最强 signal），lzm 的额外 power 主要来自 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 的\n      complementary signal。当 MMLU 信号已很强时，aggregation 的 marginal gain 有限\n      （diminishing returns）。\n      \n      (2) 但在 MMLU 单独 power 不足的 low-contamination regime（5%），lzm 的 cross-benchmark\n      aggregation 更有价值（AUROC 从 ~0.78 到 0.83），因为多个 weak signals 合并后\n      超过 detection threshold。\n      \n      (3) Correlation 0.96 with mean lz* 说明 lzm 本质上是 weighted average 的\n      formal version，但它提供了 proper statistical inference（p-value, CI）而 mean lz*\n      没有。\n      \n      (4) Phase B 11/12 flagged（vs 之前全部 flagged）：lzm 的标准化使得一个模型\n      （能力最低、各 benchmark 都差但不 aberrant）脱离 flagging zone。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lzm vs per-benchmark Detection\"\n        columns: [\"Level\", \"AUROC(best single)\", \"AUROC(lzm)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", \"0.78 (MMLU)\", \"0.83\", \"+0.05\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.94 (MMLU)\", \"0.96\", \"+0.02\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"0.99 (MMLU)\", \"0.99\", \"+0.00\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: lzm score distribution for Phase B 12 models. Gemini-1.5 as extreme outlier (lzm=42.3). Other flagged models clustered around lzm=15-25.\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 作为 supplementary statistic 有价值但不改变主要结论。写入 paper 作为 Section 5.3\n      的 cross-benchmark aggregation method。最大 value 是为 Claim 3 的 \"model-level\n      contamination profile\" 提供 formal single-number summary。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 注入 15%/50% MMLU contamination，然后 GRPO 训练 2-3 epochs\n      （rule-based reward on held-out tasks），测试 person-fit signal 在 RL 后是否保留。\n      直接回应 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA 失效问题。\n    expected_results:\n      # Pre-RL (SFT only) — from exp-ctrl-contam\n      pre_rl_delta_lz_15pct: -4.6\n      pre_rl_delta_lz_50pct: -13.1\n      # Post-RL\n      post_rl_delta_lz_15pct: -2.9\n      post_rl_delta_lz_50pct: -9.2\n      signal_retention_15pct: 0.63\n      signal_retention_50pct: 0.70\n      post_rl_auroc_15pct: 0.88\n      post_rl_auroc_50pct: 0.97\n      # MIA comparison\n      mia_minkpp_auroc_post_rl_15pct: 0.58\n      mia_minkpp_auroc_post_rl_50pct: 0.64\n      accuracy_change_post_rl_contam_items: -0.02\n      accuracy_change_post_rl_clean_items: +0.03\n      key_finding: \"62-70% of Δlz* signal retained post-RL; Min-K%++ drops to near-chance (AUROC 0.58)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 signal_retention [0.4, 0.8]。预测 63%/70%：\n      \n      (1) RL（GRPO）通过 policy gradient 优化 reward，不直接 target memorized items 的\n      parameter space。SFT 产生的 contamination 存储在模型的 specific parameter subspace\n      （QLoRA 的 adapter weights），GRPO 主要调整 policy 的 general behavior patterns\n      （format compliance, reasoning style），对 adapter weights 的 perturbation 是 indirect\n      且 partial。因此 majority of aberrant pattern 保留。\n      \n      (2) 保留 63% 而非 90%+：GRPO 确实会 smooth out 一些 over-confident predictions\n      on contaminated items（RL 的 KL penalty 抑制极端 probability），导致部分 aberrant\n      signal 削弱。且 RL 在 clean tasks 上的 general improvement（+3pp accuracy）\n      slightly raises baseline，缩小 Δlz*。\n      \n      (3) 50% contamination 保留率更高（70% vs 63%）：信号更强，RL 的 smoothing effect\n      按比例影响更小（absolute Δlz* 大，relative reduction 小）。\n      \n      (4) Min-K%++ AUROC 暴跌到 0.58（near chance）：这正是 Wang et al. (2025) 的发现。\n      MIA 方法依赖 token-level probability patterns that are characteristic of training data，\n      RL 重新分配了 token probability mass（reward-optimized generation ≠ SFT memorization），\n      破坏了 MIA 的 detection signal。但 IRT-FIT 的 binary response pattern 更 robust：\n      只要 contaminated items 仍被答对（accuracy 仅降 2pp），aberrant pattern 就存在。\n      \n      (5) 这个对比是论文最强 selling point 之一：\"IRT-FIT retains 63% detection power\n      post-RL where token-level methods fail (AUROC 0.58 vs 0.88)\"，直接回应领域的\n      open problem。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"15% contam\", \"50% contam\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Δlz* pre-RL\", \"-4.6\", \"-13.1\"]\n          - [\"Δlz* post-RL\", \"-2.9\", \"-9.2\"]\n          - [\"Retention\", \"63%\", \"70%\"]\n          - [\"AUROC pre-RL\", \"0.94\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"AUROC post-RL\", \"0.88\", \"0.97\"]\n      - name: \"Table: IRT-FIT vs Min-K%++ Post-RL\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"AUROC pre-RL (15%)\", \"AUROC post-RL (15%)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT (binary)\", \"0.94\", \"0.88\", \"-0.06\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++ (token probs)\", \"0.97\", \"0.58\", \"-0.39\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Bar chart of AUROC pre-RL vs post-RL for IRT-FIT and Min-K%++. IRT-FIT bar barely changes; Min-K%++ collapses.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Δlz* trajectory through SFT→RL training. X-axis = training stage (clean → SFT → RL epoch 1 → RL epoch 2 → RL epoch 3). Shows gradual partial recovery but majority of signal retained.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 实验提供 Wang et al. (2025) 的直接 rebuttal。IRT-FIT 的 robustness 来自\n      fundamental difference in signal type：binary pattern aberrance vs token probability\n      memorization signature。这是 paper 的 strongest \"additional contribution\"，\n      升级为 main-body result（非 appendix）。\n\n  - name: \"Extended Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: >\n      添加 BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n      获取或校准 4PL 参数，运行 simulation + 控制实验验证。\n    expected_results:\n      bbh_n_items: 6511\n      math_n_items: 5000\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.87\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.78\n      bbh_ctrl_auroc_15pct: 0.85\n      math_ctrl_auroc_15pct: 0.76\n      power_theory_R2_with_new_benchmarks: 0.97\n      bbh_dual_regime_crossover: \"78-83%\"\n      math_dual_regime_crossover: \"80-85%\"\n      key_finding: \"BBH and MATH fill the 1K-10K gap, confirming power∝sqrt(n) theory with R²=0.97\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      BBH (6.5K items) 和 MATH (5K items) 填充 GSM8K(1.3K) 和 HellaSwag(10K) 之间的空白。\n      \n      (1) BBH power 0.87 at 15%：n=6511 接近但低于 exp-power-theory 的 min_items_15pct_80power\n      =7958 阈值。But 超过 80% 因为 BBH items 的 difficulty distribution 比 MMLU 更 dispersed\n      （包含 very hard reasoning tasks），提供 more discriminating power per item。\n      \n      (2) MATH power 0.78 at 15%：n=5000 更远低于 7958 阈值，且 MATH 的 items 有 high\n      inter-correlation（数学推理 chains share common skills），violating local independence\n      更严重，effective n_items < nominal 5000。但 0.78 仍接近 0.80 可用阈值。\n      \n      (3) 理论 R² 从 0.9572 升至 0.97：新增 2 个 data points 正好在 theory gap region，\n      且 actual power 与 sqrt(n) 预测 well-aligned，tightening the fit。这是 Claim 2 的\n      strongest evidence——power function 不仅理论成立，在 7 个 benchmarks 上 empirically\n      验证。\n      \n      (4) Dual-regime crossover 在 78-85% 范围，与其他 benchmarks 一致，confirming\n      crossover 是 benchmark-invariant property（由 IRT model 结构决定，不依赖 specific items）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Power Function Across 7 Benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Sim Power@15%\", \"Ctrl AUROC@15%\", \"Theory Pred\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"14042\", \"0.978\", \"0.94\", \"0.97\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"10042\", \"0.753\", \"0.90\", \"0.89\"]\n          - [\"BBH\", \"6511\", \"0.87\", \"0.85\", \"0.84\"]\n          - [\"MATH\", \"5000\", \"0.78\", \"0.76\", \"0.79\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"1319\", \"0.591\", \"0.72\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", \"1172\", \"0.129\", \"—\", \"0.48\"]\n          - [\"HumanEval\", \"164\", \"0.243\", \"—\", \"0.18\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power vs sqrt(n_items) with 7 benchmarks. Theoretical curve (solid line) with empirical points. BBH and MATH fall right on the curve, eliminating the previous gap.\"\n    analysis: >\n      BBH 和 MATH 将 Claim 2 的 empirical support 从 5 benchmarks 扩展到 7，且关键地填充了\n      1K-10K region。R²=0.97 使 \"power is a predictable function of n_items\" 从 claim 升级为\n      near-law。\n\n  - name: \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 MMLU 57 subjects × 4 categories 分别计算 person-fit，识别 contamination 的\n      domain specificity。在 Phase B (Gemini-1.5) 和控制实验模型上运行。\n    expected_results:\n      n_mmlu_subjects: 57\n      n_mmlu_categories: 4\n      gemini15_flagged_subjects: 57\n      gemini15_domain_variance: \"low (all uniformly extreme)\"\n      ctrl_contam_domain_concentration: \"high — contamination signal concentrated in contaminated-item subjects\"\n      ctrl_contam_non_contam_domain_lz_change: \"<0.3 SD\"\n      ctrl_contam_contam_domain_lz_change: \">2.0 SD\"\n      domain_level_auroc_mmlu_15pct: 0.82\n      domain_level_specificity_advantage: \"identifies which subjects were contaminated\"\n      key_finding: \"Domain-level analysis reveals contamination is localized — Δlz* concentrates in contaminated subject areas with minimal spillover\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) Gemini-1.5 的 domain analysis 不 informative：acc=1.000 意味着所有 57 subjects\n      全部 100%，所以 lz* 在每个 domain 都 extreme。这 confirms \"full contamination\"\n      但不 reveals selectivity。\n      \n      (2) 控制实验的 domain analysis 才是关键发现：SFT 注入 15% random items，这些 items\n      分布在多个 subjects 中。Domain-level lz* 变化应 concentrate 在 contaminated items\n      密度高的 subjects（因 random sampling，大 subjects 贡献更多 contaminated items）。\n      \n      (3) Non-contaminated domains 的 lz* 变化 <0.3 SD：SFT 的 generalization 在 best 档\n      下有限。QLoRA 的 low-rank update 主要 memorize exact items 而非 transfer to related\n      items。这是 best 档核心假设 \"SFT 污染产生局部异常模式为主，泛化效应有限\" 的直接验证。\n      \n      (4) Domain-level AUROC 0.82（低于 whole-benchmark 0.94）：per-domain n_items 更小\n      （MMLU 57 subjects 平均 ~246 items/subject），power 降低。但仍超过 0.80，提供\n      subject-level contamination localization 能力。\n      \n      (5) 这个分析回应 R5 (\"SFT generalization smooths signal\")：empirical evidence 表明\n      SFT contamination 不 generalize，lz* signal 是 localized 的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Domain-Level Δlz* (Controlled Experiment, 15% contamination, averaged)\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"n_subjects\", \"Avg Δlz* (contam subjects)\", \"Avg Δlz* (clean subjects)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"STEM\", \"18\", \"-3.8\", \"-0.2\"]\n          - [\"Humanities\", \"13\", \"-4.1\", \"-0.1\"]\n          - [\"Social Sciences\", \"12\", \"-3.5\", \"-0.3\"]\n          - [\"Other\", \"14\", \"-3.9\", \"-0.2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Heatmap of Δlz* by subject (57 rows) × model (4 columns). Contaminated subjects show clear dark bands; clean subjects remain near zero.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Histogram of per-subject Δlz* split by contaminated (red) vs clean (blue) subjects. Clear bimodal separation.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain analysis 提供 contamination localization — 不仅检测 \"是否污染\" 还能指出\n      \"哪些 subjects 被污染\"。这是 IRT-FIT 相对于 model-level methods 的 unique capability，\n      因为 item-level response pattern 天然支持 disaggregation。写入 paper Section 5.4。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"b274d9b3-3643-46ca-a844-af844970b704","total_cost_usd":0.48848125000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14775,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":15214,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14775,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":15214,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14775},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":9737,"outputTokens":24,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.009857000000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":15214,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":14775,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.47862425000000003,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"cb9b3fab-e4f2-4214-9ac3-fd1a1eb0a330"}
